-- חוזר לבעלויות תשע"ט/7: הסכם שכר קיבוצי מיום 28.4.2019 עם ארגון המורים בחטיבות העליונות — תיקון הנספחים להסכם השכר מיום 14.3.2018
-- The agreement of 28.4.2019 replaces annexes A-D of the wage agreement of
-- 14.3.2018 (circular תשע"ח/3) with combined-salary tables that add two
-- grades — the professional instructor certified in practice and the
-- intermediate grade — and says how the differences are paid.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT common

-- Time in the regulative rules is counted in salary months from September
-- 2018 (= 1): May 2019 is 9, June 2019 is 10.

§ `חוזר תשע"ט/7 תיקון נספחי הסכם השכר מיום 14.3.2018`

-- akn:preamble/p1 akn:preamble/p2 akn:preamble/p3 akn:preamble/p4 akn:preamble/p5 akn:preamble/p6 akn:preamble/p7 akn:preamble/p8 akn:preamble/p9 akn:preamble/p10 akn:preamble/p11 akn:preamble/p12 The letterhead, date, reference, addressee, greeting and subject line; no rule.

-- akn:preamble/p13 akn:preamble/p14 The recital: the annexes of the agreement of 14.3.2018 were amended on 28.4.2019 to add tables for the professional instructor certified in practice and the intermediate grade, and are attached; the tables are encoded below.

@desc An upper-division teaching employee, as far as this circular asks.
DECLARE `employee` HAS
    `covered by the Oz LeTmura agreement of 14.8.2011` IS A BOOLEAN @desc whether or not employed under the reform's terms
    `in the reform`  IS A BOOLEAN
    `a principal`    IS A BOOLEAN

@ref akn:art_1/p1
GIVEN e IS AN `employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the agreement applies to` e IF
    e's `covered by the Oz LeTmura agreement of 14.8.2011`

@desc The salary grade, the columns of the annexed tables in their printed order.
DECLARE `salary grade` IS ONE OF
    `doctor`
    `second degree (MA)`
    `first degree (BA)`
    `senior teacher or certified professional instructor`
    `certified teacher`
    `professional instructor certified in practice`
    `intermediate professional instructor`

@desc One printed row of an annexed table: the year of seniority (or grade) and the monthly combined salary of a full position in each grade.
DECLARE `salary row` HAS
    `seniority year`           IS A NUMBER
    `doctor's salary`          IS A NUMBER
    `MA salary`                IS A NUMBER
    `BA salary`                IS A NUMBER
    `senior teacher's salary`  IS A NUMBER
    `certified teacher's salary` IS A NUMBER
    `certified-in-practice instructor's salary` IS A NUMBER
    `intermediate instructor's salary` IS A NUMBER

GIVEN r IS A `salary row`, g IS A `salary grade`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the cell for` r g IS
    CONSIDER g
    WHEN `doctor` THEN r's `doctor's salary`
    WHEN `second degree (MA)` THEN r's `MA salary`
    WHEN `first degree (BA)` THEN r's `BA salary`
    WHEN `senior teacher or certified professional instructor` THEN r's `senior teacher's salary`
    WHEN `certified teacher` THEN r's `certified teacher's salary`
    WHEN `professional instructor certified in practice` THEN r's `certified-in-practice instructor's salary`
    WHEN `intermediate professional instructor` THEN r's `intermediate instructor's salary`

`all grades` MEANS
    LIST `doctor`, `second degree (MA)`, `first degree (BA)`, `senior teacher or certified professional instructor`,
         `certified teacher`, `professional instructor certified in practice`, `intermediate professional instructor`

§§ `2 החלפת נספחים`

-- §2a-§2b: annexes A, B and C (section 4.1 of the agreement of 14.3.2018)
-- and annex D are replaced by those attached; §3's list names them and
-- their dates. §2b places annex D in "subsection 4.2"; as circular תשע"ח/3
-- prints the agreement, 4.2 attaches A-C and annex D is in 4.3-4.4. Annex D
-- is named, so nothing turns on it.
DECLARE `annex` IS ONE OF
    `annex A, reform, from 1.9.2017`
    `annex B, reform, from 1.9.2018`
    `annex C, reform, from 1.12.2018`
    `annex D, outside the reform and principals, from 1.9.2018`

-- akn:att_1__hc_1/p1 akn:att_1__hc_1/p2 akn:att_1__hc_1/p3 akn:att_1__hc_1/p4 akn:att_2__hc_1/p2 akn:att_2__hc_1/p3 akn:att_2__hc_1/p4 akn:att_2__hc_1/p5 akn:att_3__hc_1/p2 akn:att_3__hc_1/p3 akn:att_3__hc_1/p4 akn:att_3__hc_1/p5 akn:att_4__hc_1/p2 akn:att_4__hc_1/p3 akn:att_4__hc_1/p4 akn:att_4__hc_1/p5 The annexes' letterheads; no rule.

