GIVEN a IS AN `annex`
GIVETH A LIST OF `salary row`
DECIDE `the rows of` a IS
    CONSIDER a
    WHEN `annex A, reform, from 1.9.2017` THEN `annex A`
    WHEN `annex B, reform, from 1.9.2018` THEN `annex B`
    WHEN `annex C, reform, from 1.12.2018` THEN `annex C`
    WHEN `annex D, outside the reform and principals, from 1.9.2018` THEN `annex D`

-- §2: the annex in force for the employee on a day, as the annexes' own
-- headings date them (§3's list); none of this circular's annexes covers
-- one outside the reform before 1.9.2018.
@ref akn:art_2__para_a akn:art_2__para_b
GIVEN e IS AN `employee`, `the day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE `annex`
DECIDE `the annex in force for` e `the day` IS
    IF e's `in the reform` AND NOT e's `a principal`
    THEN IF `the day` AT LEAST Date 1 12 2018
         THEN JUST `annex C, reform, from 1.12.2018`
         ELSE IF `the day` AT LEAST Date 1 9 2018
              THEN JUST `annex B, reform, from 1.9.2018`
              ELSE IF `the day` AT LEAST Date 1 9 2017
                   THEN JUST `annex A, reform, from 1.9.2017`
                   ELSE NOTHING
    ELSE IF `the day` AT LEAST Date 1 9 2018
         THEN JUST `annex D, outside the reform and principals, from 1.9.2018`
         ELSE NOTHING

@export default The monthly combined salary of a full position for an upper-division teaching employee, from the annexes the owners' circular 5779/7 substitutes into the wage agreement of 14 March 2018
@ref akn:art_2__para_a akn:art_2__para_b
GIVEN e IS AN `employee` @desc the employee
      `the day` IS A DATE @desc the day the salary is for
      g IS A `salary grade` @desc the employee's salary grade
      `seniority` IS A NUMBER @desc the year of seniority, 1 to 36
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `combined salary` e `the day` g `seniority` IS
    CONSIDER `the annex in force for` e `the day`
    WHEN JUST a THEN sum (map (GIVEN r YIELD `the cell for` r g)
                              (filter (GIVEN r YIELD r's `seniority year` EQUALS `seniority`) (`the rows of` a)))
    WHEN NOTHING THEN 0

§§ `3 תשלומים והפרשי שכר`

DECLARE `differences action` IS ONE OF
    `pay the differences` HAS `differences paid` IS A NUMBER
    `deduct salary because of the replaced annexes` HAS `deduction` IS A NUMBER

-- §3 ¶1: differences arising from §2 are paid from the May 2019 salary (9),
-- no later than June's (10).
@ref akn:art_3/p1
GIVEN `differences owed` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `differences action`
DECIDE `paying the differences` `differences owed` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the differences` `paid`
          PROVIDED `paid` AT LEAST `differences owed`
    WITHIN 10
    LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "section 3: the differences no later than the salary for June 2019"

-- §3 ¶2: what was already paid for 1.9.2017 on is not paid again.
@ref akn:art_3/p2
GIVEN `owed under the replaced annexes` IS A NUMBER, `already paid under the agreement` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the differences owed` `owed under the replaced annexes` `already paid under the agreement` IS
    max 0 (`owed under the replaced annexes` MINUS `already paid under the agreement`)

-- §3 ¶3: no salary is deducted because the annexes were replaced.
@ref akn:art_3/p3
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `differences action`
DECIDE `no deduction for the replaced annexes` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    SHANT `deduct salary because of the replaced annexes` `any amount`
    WITHIN 10
    LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "section 3: no deduction results from replacing the annexes"

-- akn:conclusions The sign-off and the copies list; no rule.

-- Findings. The rule the annexes serve is section 4.1 of the agreement of
-- 14.3.2018, as circular תשע"ח/3 publishes it and as §2 here cites it: from
-- 1.9.2018 the tables are updated "for seniority 1 to 7" (annex B), and from
-- 1.12.2018 "by a further 1.2%" (annex C).
@desc The highest year of seniority section 4.1(2) of the agreement of 14.3.2018 (circular 5778/3) updates on 1.9.2018.
`the last year section 4.1(2) updates` MEANS 7
@desc The further update section 4.1(3) of the agreement of 14.3.2018 (circular 5778/3) makes on 1.12.2018.
`the further update of 1.12.2018` MEANS 0.012

GIVEN x IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `to the agora` x IS TRUNC (x PLUS 0.005) 2

GIVEN a IS A `salary row`, b IS A `salary row`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `cells that differ` a b IS
    count (filter (GIVEN g YIELD NOT (`the cell for` a g EQUALS `the cell for` b g)) `all grades`)

GIVEN b IS A `salary row`, c IS A `salary row`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `cells that miss the 1.2% update` b c IS
    count (filter (GIVEN g YIELD NOT (`to the agora` (`the cell for` b g TIMES (1 PLUS `the further update of 1.12.2018`)) EQUALS `the cell for` c g))
                  `all grades`)

-- F-2018-19_tashat_07-a: annex B changes 107 of the 203 cells at seniority
-- 8 to 36 from annex A, by one or two agorot.
`cells of annex B above year 7 that differ from annex A` MEANS
    sum (zipWith `cells that differ` (drop `the last year section 4.1(2) updates` `annex A`) (drop `the last year section 4.1(2) updates` `annex B`))
`annex B changes years section 4.1(2) does not update` MEANS
    `cells of annex B above year 7 that differ from annex A` EQUALS 107
#ASSERT `annex B changes years section 4.1(2) does not update`

GIVEN a IS A `salary row`, b IS A `salary row`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `within two agorot` a b IF
    all (GIVEN g YIELD `the cell for` a g MINUS `the cell for` b g AT MOST 0.02
                   AND `the cell for` b g MINUS `the cell for` a g AT MOST 0.02)
        `all grades`
#ASSERT and (zipWith `within two agorot` (drop 7 `annex A`) (drop 7 `annex B`))

-- F-2018-19_tashat_07-b: annex C is annex B raised 1.2% and rounded to the
-- agora in 201 of its 252 cells, not in the other 51.
`cells of annex C that 1.2% on annex B does not give` MEANS
    sum (zipWith `cells that miss the 1.2% update` `annex B` `annex C`)
`annex C is not 1.2% on annex B` MEANS
    `cells of annex C that 1.2% on annex B does not give` EQUALS 51
#ASSERT `annex C is not 1.2% on annex B`

-- Examples. Each annex has 36 rows, years 1 to 36.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN a YIELD map (GIVEN r YIELD r's `seniority year`) (`the rows of` a) EQUALS range 1 36)
            (LIST `annex A, reform, from 1.9.2017`, `annex B, reform, from 1.9.2018`, `annex C, reform, from 1.12.2018`, `annex D, outside the reform and principals, from 1.9.2018`)

`a reform teacher` MEANS `employee` WITH
    `covered by the Oz LeTmura agreement of 14.8.2011` IS TRUE
    `in the reform` IS TRUE
    `a principal` IS FALSE
`a teacher outside the reform` MEANS `employee` WITH
    `covered by the Oz LeTmura agreement of 14.8.2011` IS TRUE
    `in the reform` IS FALSE
    `a principal` IS FALSE

#ASSERT `combined salary` `a reform teacher` (Date 1 10 2017) `professional instructor certified in practice` 1 EQUALS 3116.61
#ASSERT `combined salary` `a reform teacher` (Date 1 10 2018) `doctor` 1 EQUALS 4734.36
#ASSERT `combined salary` `a reform teacher` (Date 1 1 2019) `doctor` 1 EQUALS 4791.17
#ASSERT `combined salary` `a teacher outside the reform` (Date 1 1 2019) `doctor` 1 EQUALS 4004.97
#ASSERT `combined salary` `a teacher outside the reform` (Date 1 1 2018) `doctor` 1 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the differences owed` 1000 400 EQUALS 600

#TRACE `paying the differences` 600 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `pay the differences` 600 AT 9
#TRACE `no deduction for the replaced annexes` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `deduct salary because of the replaced annexes` 50 AT 9
